 the Liverpool Football Club play at Anfield Stadium and to explore the Beatles heritage synonymous with this working class city of the North."},{"id":"kepg_pl_c0375f316f0f702ecf8abdd8_epg_1795287000","title":"Wild Spirit 17","released":"2026-11-21T18:50:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-21T18:50:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-21T19:15:00Z","runtime":"25 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_c0375f316f0f702ecf8abdd8_epg_1795288500","title":"Going South","released":"2026-11-21T19:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-21T19:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-21T19:40:00Z","runtime":"25 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_c0375f316f0f702ecf8abdd8_epg_1795290000","title":"Drone Wars","released":"2026-11-21T19:40:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-21T19:40:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-21T20:35:00Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_c0375f316f0f702ecf8abdd8_epg_1795293300","title":"French Fire Force","released":"2026-11-21T20:35:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-21T20:35:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-21T21:25:00Z","runtime":"50 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_c0375f316f0f702ecf8abdd8_epg_1795296300","title":"The Global Barber","released":"2026-11-21T21:25:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-21T21:25:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-21T21:50:00Z","runtime":"25 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_c0375f316f0f702ecf8abdd8_epg_1795297800","title":"The Global Barber","released":"2026-11-21T21:50:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-21T21:50:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-21T22:15:00Z","runtime":"25 min","description":"The Global Barber joins Benny \"The Barber\" Walsh for the day, working at Refinery Salon & Barber in Newcastle, Ontario, Canada. A nice surprise for Cedric when he finds that Benny set him up to cut Neil Sanderson's (Drummer for Three Days Grace) hair. While visiting Newcastle, Cedric takes to the water with Captain Dave Chatterton of Fish Finder Charters, in search of Salmon and Rainbow Trout. Brad Hopkins, bass player from \"Chalk Circle\" and Newcastle native, joins Cedric and Captain Dave for the trip on Lake Ontario in search of fish. After a long, hard day on the water, everyone heads to th"},{"id":"kepg_pl